    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d333-a1">

                <pb facs="0465" n="385" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg385"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Captain Baxter to Mr. Buck.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nagasaki</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic">November 17,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Advised that Japanese admiralty sent two warships with salvage appliances to help
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Hancock</hi> near Moji. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hancock</hi> floated high tide 16th uninjured, and sailed same day to
                    relieve <hi rendition="#italic">Warren</hi> at Kobe. Action Japanese admiralty
                    greatly appreciated. This office will promptly pay admiralty’s bill of
                    expense.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Baxter.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
